#### c) Compensation for standing crops; 

The norms for crop compensation and interest charges are not uniform.. The provision of crop compensation is normally made at a suitable rate per hectare on a percentage of cultivated land being acquired. It is seen that this percentage ranges between generally 25% to 50% of the agricultural land being acquired.

